        "Content": "Entrance Hall (20.83ft x 6.07ft) with coving, recessed lights and cloak closest.\r\nSitting Room (13.94ft x 13.55ft) into bay window with fireplace and coving.\r\nLiving Room (15.09ft x 14.93ft) with coving, fireplace and French doors leading to wooden deck.\r\nKitchen (10.33ft x 14.76ft) with oak built-in ground and eye level presses, electric oven, wood panel ceiling, electric hob, integrated dishwasher, s.s. sink unit, integrated fridge, tiled floor and surround, double doors leading to:\r\nConservatory (15.09ft x 11.81ft) with brick wall and French doors.\r\nUtility Room (12.66ft x 10.07ft) with fitted presses, plumbed and tiled floor.\r\nToilet w.c., w.h.b., tiled floor and surround.\r\nFamily Bathroom (11.81ft x 8.53ft) w.c., w.h.b., bath with shower attachment, fitted presses, electric shower, tiled floor and surround.\r\nBedroom 1 (14.76ft x 12.80ft) with bay window, coving and range of built-in wardrobes.\r\nEn-suite w.c., w.h.b., coving, pump shower and tile surround.\r\nBedroom 2 (11.81ft x 11.98ft) with coving and range of built-in wardrobes.\r\nBedroom 3 (14.11ft x 12.24ft) with coving and range of built-in wardrobes.\r\nBedroom 4 with study desk, presses, coving and range of built-in wardrobes.\r\nHotpress walk-in."
